 "description_html": "<h1>Blender Add-on for Splitting 3D Models for Printing</h1><h2>Cut. Connect. Print.</h2><p><strong>Fast cutting, automatic connectors, and non-destructive cut planning for Blender.</strong></p><p>CatPin helps you split Blender models into printable parts, add matching connectors, and export the final parts for 3D printing.</p><p>Choose <strong>Draft Mode</strong> for full control or <strong>Easy Mode</strong> for fast automatic cuts.</p><h2><strong>Latest Tutorial</strong></h2><div class=\"tiptap__raw\" data-title=\"CatPin_Tutorial\" data-url=\"https://kinescope.io/embed/e05c4f37-bd48-47f3-ac1f-d4",
